cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use the MTA-Net software or dataset, please cite the archived version you used."
title: "MTA-Net: Grain-size composition prediction from sedimentary simulation images"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shao
    given-names: Yanlin
    affiliation: Yangtze University
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Jiaxuan
    affiliation: Yangtze University
