    affiliation: Yangtze University
repository-code: "https://github.com/luckycutelove01-bit/MTA-Net"
abstract: >-
  MTA-Net estimates five grain-size volume fractions from sedimentary
  simulation images. This repository includes the implementation, scripts,
  202 paired RGB TIFF images and measured grain-size labels. The original
  code is under the MIT License. The images and measured labels are under
  CC BY 4.0.
